      "text": "# 创作意图结构化研究｜L1\n\n## 三个上位方向中的③深挖\n创作主权 WHY\n→ 审美判断 JUDGE\n→ 创作意图 REPRESENT\n\n## 5轮研究全部完成\nR1 DONE\nR2 DONE\nR3 DONE\nR4 DONE\nR5 DONE\n\n**RESEARCH DESIGN DONE**\n**EMPIRICAL VALIDATION PENDING**"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# A｜Attribute / Taxonomy\n\n意图 → 属性变量\nitem / silhouette / color / material / style\n\n强：WHAT\n弱：关系 / 主次 / 动态"
